  {
    "id": 29,
    "title": "Add “Add to Underrated” Button on Details Page",
    "ai_description": "Implement an “Add to Underrated” action on the anime/manga details page that allows users to submit entries directly using the existing backend APIs.\n\nScope\nAdd a button on:\n* Anime details page\n* Manga details page\n\nOn click:\n* Open a small form/modal (or inline input)\n\nCollect:\n* reason (required)\n\nAutomatically send:\n* anilist_id (from current item)\n* mal_id (if available)\n* anilist_user_id (current user)\n* mal_user_id (if linked)\n* author (username)\n\nAPI Integration\n* Anime: POST /api/add_anime\n* Manga: POST /api/add_manga\nPayload:\n{\n  \"anilist_id\": 1535,\n  \"anilist_user_id\": 123456,\n  \"mal_user_id\": 789012,\n  \"author\": \"Sheby\",\n  \"reason\": \"Really underrated gem\",\n  \"mal_id\": 1376\n}\n\nUI/UX\n* Show success toast/snackbar on submit\n* Handle errors (API fail, missing data)\n* Disable button while submitting\n* Optional: prevent duplicate submissions\n\nNotes\nAPIs are already available and ready to use\n\nIf implementation becomes complex or time consuming, fallback is to continue using the bot instead",
